      "content": "The if Statement"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The syntax for the if statement is:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "content": "if (boolean_expression) {\n    // statement(s)\n}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Here, the if statement executes the code inside { } based on boolean_expression."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "If boolean_expression evaluates to:"
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "items": [
        "true, the code inside { } is executed.",
        "false, the code inside { } is skipped."
      ]
    },
